# Keep the build context small and the image clean.
#
# Without this the context is ~1.0 GB across 33k files (node_modules 765M,
# .next 243M), uploaded to the builder on every deploy.
#
# It also matters for correctness: the build stage does
#   COPY --from=deps /app/node_modules ./node_modules
#   COPY . .
# so a host node_modules in the context overwrites the Linux install from the
# deps stage with macOS-built binaries (Prisma's query engine is native).

node_modules
.next
out
build
dist

.git
.gitignore

# Secrets come from Fly at runtime; never bake a local .env into the image.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts

.DS_Store
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

Dockerfile
.dockerignore
fly.toml
README.md
LICENSE
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
